 "actualReturnedReportText": "# RU046 independent whole-batch review\n\n## Snapshot\nR: C:\\Users\\stop-\\learning-japanese-ru; branch full-ru-046-time-sequence-positions; HEAD 5d1cefe0e5fa3bbab78a7a2e6da00df72012e07d.\nS: C:\\Users\\stop-\\.copilot\\session-state\\68a44f7f-62db-4755-8296-fd586c861a35\\files\\ru-full-scope-en-6af98cb; HEAD 6af98cb717755690a9ca793e5454a96ebd7a8f9f.\nAccepted baseline: 0ba57de6f3f1fc58132e7ddb4a04323ec7a80e96. Both HEADs and R tracked-clean were checked repeatedly, including at completion. No retargeting.\n\n## Actual scope\n- All62 assigned complete EN/RU pairs:16 new lessons,842 RU lines, plus46 contextual baseline pairs;124 complete bodies. pairs[0:62], successful adjacent two-pair calls.\n- Additionally one targeted complete bilingual pair, words\\向こう.md: two more bodies. english[0:1]: complete EN-only 始める support body, not a RU runtime provider.\n- All860 displayed captions, not860 complete lessons: pool[0:800] in100-row calls, then[800:860]. Compared both directions against16 new Japanese prompts, including applicable alternate readings/sense restrictions.\n- All55 complete proposed rationales: proposals[0:55], five per call; separately the preserved 後–後ろ edge. Thus56 existing direct pairs, not a transitive clique.\n- All123 complete official JMdict objects: objects[0:110] in five-object calls, [110:116], [116:120], [120:123]. Also complete1277140 for 向こう, from the hash-verified cached official archive. Total124 objects; entity-expanded serialized XML, not archive raw slices.\n- Three complete private Russian primary entries голова/старый/начало: russian[0:1],[1:3]. Bodies remain private. Complete extracted PDF pages[0:1],[5:6],[25:26],[26:27]: authority/date, foreword, entire item105 across printed22–23; no pixel inspection.\n- Active guidance fully read: guide0 union[0:385] (actual385 lines), guide1[0:253], guide2[0:138], guide3[0:107], guide4[0:110]. Frozen wordformat[0:85], confusable[0:356], levels[0:90],[180:401]. All thre